# Raw COMSOL exports can be large; commit only small, curated exports
data/comsol_exports/*
!data/comsol_exports/README.md
!data/comsol_exports/examples/
data/raw/*
!data/raw/README.md

# Generated plots
plots/*
!plots/README.md

